+### Saved Views and Custom Presets
+Saved views allow engineers and leads to persist, share, and rapidly recall customized viewport configurations across all 5 native layouts:
+- **Private vs Workspace-Shared Scope:** Views can be saved as private (accessible only to the creator) or workspace-shared (visible and selectable by all workspace members).
+- **Configuration Persistence:** A saved view captures active filter predicates, text search queries, state selections, 2D swimlane grouping criteria, sort ordering, and layout mode (`board`, `list`, `table`, `calendar`, `timeline`).
+- **Preset Management:** Users can update existing presets, duplicate views with modified parameters, set a default intake view, and rename or archive obsolete presets without mutating underlying issue records.
